  "description": "Kim Seunghyun works in the post-incident response unit of Special Esper Crime Task Force Team 1. His daily life is nothing but stress thanks to his assignment: managing Seo Rahel, an unhinged esper agent so troublesome that even the government has given up on him.\n\nOne night, while cleaning up after Rahel and working overtime with a nosebleed, Seunghyun is suddenly kidnapped by unknown assailants... and wakes up to find himself locked in the same room as Rahel.\n\nSeunghyun’s body begins burning up from an unknown poison, Rahel claims that his powers have been sealed, and a cult-like group has left behind a note saying that the only way they can escape is by having sex.\n\nCan Seunghyun make it out safely?\n\n_Source: BOMTOON, translated_",
